## 25. 补充参考文献与精确实例

[OM24] Ron Ofir and Michael Margaliot. *Multiplicative and additive compounds via Kronecker products and Kronecker sums*. arXiv:2401.02100. 本文借鉴其实际 compound/Kronecker 语境，不把外幂矩阵公式的存在宣称为新结果。
